94,"version":33,"versionNonce":1873795782,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[{"id":"5jVQSF0isw3pfIGsHkq6i","type":"arrow"},{"type":"text","id":"5Xg_auW8GX-5MTIUMyrW_"}],"updated":1782159997033,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"5Xg_auW8GX-5MTIUMyrW_","type":"text","x":3635.4447021898045,"y":890.1985829589228,"width":187,"height":25,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b0xV","roundness":null,"seed":772974554,"version":19,"versionNonce":934890010,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782159999044,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"retailerProductId","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":8,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"mUeQxEhY7YiiQ_pmmFuRI","originalText":"retailerProductId","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"PfRFHFpwPGN8sUO7dsMx6","type":"text","x":3461.2317495002853,"y":-288.9465406170083,"width":2494.798583984375,"height":1085,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b0z","roundness":null,"seed":251431002,"version":2196,"versionNonce":1540287357,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782312477653,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Open Questions\n- Are we going to backfill all creators from connect into boost?\n    - yes eventually\n- Is retailer_product complete in boost compared to connect? - need to have claude investigate\n    - ask Parker / investigate this\n    - dumb import / products are not refreshed\n    - We use affiliate.com for Boost\n    - There's a limitation over 10k, so brands can upload extra asins\n- In Connect we have a computed commission_value, usage_fee_value on the invoicing amount table (equivalent to event_log)\n\n\n  Connect does store commission_value/usage_fee_value per row, but it recomputes them at \n  refresh time, over a trailing 2-month window, using the current rate (refresh_attribution_report()). Connect's commission tables hold a live value + is_active +\n  audit log — they're not effective-dated. \n\nIf you compute last 60 days, amounts are getting adjusted, not the Wayward inputted data like brand usage rate. \n    preserve full history of all of the commission rate + product enablement\n    All of the rates that we're storing must be append only \"log\" with date, effective_from verify this\n\nFetches all amazon attribution report over last 60 days, it recalculates commission value for each day + account. \n\nSo:\n\nThere's a few options here\n1. If we are invoicing at let's say monthly, should we just be retroactively applying any changes rate changes to all data from end of last invoice period?\n\n2. Other options include attaching live rate amount to each row (prefer not to do this because of complexity)\n\n\n\n","fontSize":28,"fontFamily":8,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Open Questions\n- Are we going to backfill all creators from connect into boost?\n    - yes eventually\n- Is retailer_product complete in boost compared to connect? - need to have claude investigate\n    - ask Parker / investigate this\n    - dumb import / products are not refreshed\n    - We use affiliate.com for Boost\n    - There's a limitation over 10k, so brands can upload extra asins\n- In Connect we have a computed commission_value, usage_fee_value on the invoicing amount table (equivalent to event_log)\n\n\n  Connect does store commission_value/usage_fee_value per row, but it recomputes them at \n  refresh time, over a trailing 2-month window, using the current rate (refresh_attribution_report()). Connect's commission tables hold a live value + is_active +\n  audit log — they're not effective-dated. \n\nIf you compute last 60 days, amounts are getting adjusted, not the Wayward inputted data like brand usage rate. \n    preserve full history of all of the commission rate + product enablement\n    All of the rates that we're storing must be append only \"log\" with date, effective_from verify this\n\nFetches all amazon attribution report over last 60 days, it recalculates commission value for each day + account. \n\nSo:\n\nThere's a few options here\n1. If we are invoicing at let's say monthly, should we just be retroactively applying any changes rate changes to all data from end of last invoice period?\n\n2. Other options include attaching live rate amount to each row (prefer not to do this because of complexity)\n\n\n\n","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"b1ywHReaoWSYJ3M63DMQQ","type":"rectangle","x":1882.4159332726385,"y":763.8819436105452,"width":428.397681332242,"height":67.89658269520282,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b10","roundness":{"type":3},"seed":1155992026,"version":83,"versionNonce":318134214,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[{"type":"text","id":"ul3-AgP8tn-stMKaE0ccH"}],"updated":1782163874706,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"ul3-AgP8tn-stMKaE0ccH","type":"text","x":1953.6147739387598,"y":785.3302349581467,"width":286,"height":25,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b11","roundness":null,"seed":314236422,"version":64,"versionNonce":455307014,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782163874706,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"program min commision rate","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":8,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"b1ywHReaoWSYJ3M63DMQQ","originalText":"program min commision rate","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"2UIyIKlbd_zuQL3PGbk4S","type":"line","x":2322.095887402362,"y":800.3980708440463,"width":836.9665573081938,"height":86.1125285548735,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#2f9e44","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"dotted","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b14","roundness":{"type":2},"seed":1927070746,"version":150,"versionNonce":694219910,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782163877155,"link":null,"locked":false,"points":[[0,0],[836.9665573081938,86.1125285548735]],"startBinding":null,"endBinding":null,"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":null,"polygon":false},{"id":"8LOZYSHw77L_Qs9K8QKAo","type":"rectangle","x":1975.4924612195425,"y":2117.2553427600064,"width":383.05033821262555,"height":80.83209896804965,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#f08c00","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b15","roundness":{"type":3},"seed":1098458138,"version":36,"versionNonce":956080838,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[{"type":"text","id":"F4k42wIC4_SNnWBqXFuLY"}],"updated":1782161410034,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"F4k42wIC4_SNnWBqXFuLY","type":"text","x":2029.5176303258554,"y":2145.1713922440313,"width":275,"height":25,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#f08c00","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b16","roundness":null,"seed":2129485786,"version":27,"versionNonce":1915209754,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782161417701,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"invoice (Stripe/AppSmith)","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":8,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"8LOZYSHw77L_Qs9K8QKAo","originalText":"invoice (Stripe/AppSmith)","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"I30lu5SX1pbLbLLuQNMZr","type":"rectangle","x":1972.9307853704443,"y":2259.3864242163427,"width":383.05033821262555,"height":80.83209896804965,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#f08c00","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b17","roundness":{"type":3},"seed":226323334,"version":65,"versionNonce":1444979078,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[{"type":"text","id":"-lZC_8LpmhNDNYkIxyz_s"}],"updated":1782161421217,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"-lZC_8LpmhNDNYkIxyz_s","type":"text","x":2026.9559544767571,"y":2287.3024737003675,"width":275,"height":25,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#f08c00","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b18","roundness":null,"seed":588384966,"version":90,"versionNonce":275723034,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782161554327,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"billing snapshot / export","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":8,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"I30lu5SX1pbLbLLuQNMZr","originalText":"billing snapshot / export","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"-h9nMJ2KdmLJiTem5UAsp","type":"rectangle","x":1991.1153582454845,"y":2387.719925965661,"width":383.05033821262555,"height":80.83209896804965,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#f08c00","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b19","roundness":{"type":3},"seed":1760276614,"version":95,"versionNonce":228955930,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[{"type":"text","id":"JbsXUxZIfry35uMxICxSB"}],"updated":1782164381606,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"JbsXUxZIfry35uMxICxSB","type":"text","x":2078.140527351797,"y":2415.6359754496857,"width":209,"height":25,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#f08c00","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b1A","roundness":null,"seed":1651486662,"version":140,"versionNonce":769106906,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782164381606,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"stripe customer map","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":8,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"-h9nMJ2KdmLJiTem5UAsp","originalText":"stripe customer map","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"UTxMGamKMQ9g7ApL7CF4e","type":"rectangle","x":1974.628364525929,"y":1703.9614343660094,"width":352.38596923123805,"height":85,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#e03131","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b1D","roundness":{"type":3},"seed":568663578,"version":226,"versionNonce":1612054278,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[{"type":"text","id":"NP1bgvBb9GlagJDYi0w-g"}],"updated":1782164291107,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"NP1bgvBb9GlagJDYi0w-g","type":"text","x":2007.8213491415481,"y":1721.4614343660094,"width":286,"height":50,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#e03131","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b1E","roundness":null,"seed":1049512666,"version":274,"versionNonce":1280060998,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782164291107,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"computed commission_value/\nusage_fee_value ","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":8,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"UTxMGamKMQ9g7ApL7CF4e","originalText":"computed commission_value/\nusage_fee_value ","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"xwOOkuRMizHVyHJOAXr2w","type":"text","x":5435.839029973965,"y":784.3257350739487,"width":222.48785400390625,"height":70,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b1F","roundness":null,"seed":636703622,"version":160,"versionNonce":382716742,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782165322021,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"New Billing Logic\n","fontSize":28,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"New Billing Logic\n","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"NUwVbIyjtd2gDqSH13u0b","type":"text","x":5432.848784822528,"y":917.3594046777878,"width":1324.623046875,"height":770,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b1G","roundness":null,"seed":1751277574,"version":549,"versionNonce":990830749,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782312478141,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"For each ad account A\n\n1. watermark(A) = MAX(period_to_ingest_time) from billing ledger\n\n2. windowed deltas = SUM(attributed_sales14d) FROM fetchers_event_log.amazon_attribution_products\n\n3. resolve identity to account\n\n4. Resolve commission rate\n\n5. resolve usage fee rate from brand_usage_rate\n\n6. price each line\ncommission = sales_delta * commission_rate - ? creators\n\n 7. APPEND (one BQ transaction):\n         invoice header: (account, source, period_from = watermark, period_to = cutoff,\n                          total_commission, total_usage_fee, total_amount)\n         invoice_line  : (event_date, retailer_product_id, [creator ref], sales_delta,\n                          commission_rate, commission, usage_rate, usage_fee)   -- rates FROZEN\n\n    8. assert: window contiguity/no-overlap; header total == Σ lines == Σ(delta×rate)","fontSize":28,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"For each ad account A\n\n1. watermark(A) = MAX(period_to_ingest_time) from billing ledger\n\n2. windowed deltas = SUM(attributed_sales14d) FROM fetchers_event_log.amazon_attribution_products\n\n3. resolve identity to account\n\n4. Resolve commission rate\n\n5. resolve usage fee rate from brand_usage_rate\n\n6. price each line\ncommission = sales_delta * commission_rate - ? creators\n\n 7. APPEND (one BQ transaction):\n         invoice header: (account, source, period_from = watermark, period_to = cutoff,\n                          total_commission, total_usage_fee, total_amount)\n         invoice_line  : (event_date, retailer_product_id, [creator ref], sales_delta,\n                          commission_rate, commission, usage_rate, usage_fee)   -- rates FROZEN\n\n    8. assert: window contiguity/no-overlap; header total == Σ lines == Σ(delta×rate)","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"eJ5hSDIUxPzNhjl0VZYQc","type":"text","x":1548.1758698692288,"y":1430.2236459161206,"width":269.05963134765625,"height":100,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#e03131","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b1H","roundness":null,"seed":1993879578,"version":227,"versionNonce":1715268102,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782164094279,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"This is flat right now\nEach brand has its own rate\nWe change it each billing rate\nAdd this right now","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"This is flat right now\nEach brand has its own rate\nWe change it each billing rate\nAdd this right now","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"hX63VMEW13wOGii392SAC","type":"text","x":4132.473213760201,"y":839.7764417441891,"width":929.96337890625,"height":875,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b1I","roundness":null,"seed":2007387738,"version":1117,"versionNonce":1561582938,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782180265633,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Stuff to add before we can invoice\n1. Add partnership concept\n    brand-creator restriction for earning commission\n    creators have specific deals outside the platform\n    (theoretically have to support for a full migration)\n2. brand set default commission\n3. brand usage rate\n4. product enablement \n    a. batching (doing this operation by multiple products)\n    There is a grace period (don't know when)\n\n\nAlso verify effective-from approach\n\n(append only is difficult)\n\n\nThis isn't necessary to do before we start working on invoicing logic\n- backfill brands + creators into boost\n\n- Make retailer_product refresh itself over time\n\n- Investigate allow extra asin upload although we may choose to not do it\n\n","fontSize":28,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Stuff to add before we can invoice\n1. Add partnership concept\n    brand-creator restriction for earning commission\n    creators have specific deals outside the platform\n    (theoretically have to support for a full migration)\n2. brand set default commission\n3. brand usage rate\n4. product enablement \n    a. batching (doing this operation by multiple products)\n    There is a grace period (don't know when)\n\n\nAlso verify effective-from approach\n\n(append only is difficult)\n\n\nThis isn't necessary to do before we start working on invoicing logic\n- backfill brands + creators into boost\n\n- Make retailer_product refresh itself over time\n\n- Investigate allow extra asin upload although we may choose to not do it\n\n","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"vCqJZ0aVldjPXx32QQ79F","type":"text","x":6812.485584900547,"y":-325.10866163243645,"width":1688.5384521484375,"height":770,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b1J","roundness":null,"seed":567917195,"version":854,"versionNonce":856295013,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782273587560,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Invoicing Questions\n\n  account  event_date   product  creator  attr_sales_14d  rate%  commission  usage%  usage_fee\n  1        2026-06-05   10       –        100.00          10     10.00       3       3.00\n  1        2026-06-05   14       –        100.00          10     10.00       3       3.00\n\n\n\nLet's say we have a computed ledger from event log and obviously the brand's settings,\n\nNow what we want to do is once a month, let's say on the 5th day, we:\n1. take a snapshot of the past month\n2. Human review required? \n3. Have a job take in that snapshot as input and submit to stripe\n\nOptions\n- Everything is human reviewed and has to be submitted by a human\n- There's a period where we have the visible billing summary viewable for humans and then it autosubmits to brands at a certain date\n\nAlso I wonder if I can get some more context on how we're using stripe now in Connect?\n- Do we assume one parent_brand has one stripe?\n","fontSize":28,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Invoicing Questions\n\n  account  event_date   product  creator  attr_sales_14d  rate%  commission  usage%  usage_fee\n  1        2026-06-05   10       –        100.00          10     10.00       3       3.00\n  1        2026-06-05   14       –        100.00          10     10.00       3       3.00\n\n\n\nLet's say we have a computed ledger from event log and obviously the brand's settings,\n\nNow what we want to do is once a month, let's say on the 5th day, we:\n1. take a snapshot of the past month\n2. Human review required? \n3. Have a job take in that snapshot as input and submit to stripe\n\nOptions\n- Everything is human reviewed and has to be submitted by a human\n- There's a period where we have the visible billing summary viewable for humans and then it autosubmits to brands at a certain date\n\nAlso I wonder if I can get some more context on how we're using stripe now in Connect?\n- Do we assume one parent_brand has one stripe?\n","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"C4DTkmWF6Y72qP1tmOtzm","type":"text","x":7244.43991677236,"y":734.6946668441598,"width":1256.7791748046875,"height":770,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b1K","roundness":null,"seed":1699336573,"version":555,"versionNonce":1894271037,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1782312679672,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"14 day attribution window\n\nIf brand disables tomorrow.\n\nToday there's a click that happens but no sale\n\nPurchases 13 days from now\n\nEven though brand shuts off creators, the sale would still count because the click happened \"today\"\n\nThat's how existing Wayward Connect \n\nIn T & C brand still has\n\n\nWe don't have a concept of freezing the data currently in Connect\n\nIf purchase happens 13 days from now will return the sale as happening today\n\n\n\nThe product commission should happen on the original event date","fontSize":28,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"14 day attribution window\n\nIf brand disables tomorrow.\n\nToday there's a click that happens but no sale\n\nPurchases 13 days from now\n\nEven though brand shuts off creators, the sale would still count because the click happened \"today\"\n\nThat's how existing Wayward Connect \n\nIn T & C brand still has\n\n\nWe don't have a concept of freezing the data currently in Connect\n\nIf purchase happens 13 days from now will return the sale as happening today\n\n\n\nThe product commission should happen on the original event date","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"MbLHlSSvWlm-T8mEAVga_","type":"text","x":8769.105167117403,"y":-324.2232718533525,"width":470.03570556640625,"height":315,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b1L","roundness":null,"seed":1480821878,"version":246,"versionNonce":919301814,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1782313429583,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"World 1: the way you implemented it\n[from date, to date]\n\n\nWorld 2: [from date]\nordered list \ngranule: date, program, product\nfrom [1/1] commission 1%\nfrom [1/3] commission 2 -> 3%","fontSize":28,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"World 1: the way you implemented it\n[from date, to date]\n\n\nWorld 2: [from date]\nordered list \ngranule: date, program, product\nfrom [1/1] commission 1%\nfrom [1/3] commission 2 -> 3%","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25}],"appState":{"viewBackgroundColor":"#ffffff","lockedMultiSelections":{}},"files":{}}